DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Madrid:20261121T130000
UID:adf40dac8a0451774de6538d28b707db3c540a7a97e5a9bd1ae504980bcb1262
CATEGORIES:theater
DESCRIPTION:Disponible\n\nhttps://teatrodelbarrio.com/la-diatriba-del-perr
 o/
